{
  "chapter.4755488927D41F42.title": "&dUnder the Wool",
  "chapter.4755488927D41F42.chapter_subtitle": [
    "16. Mining, caves and glitter under the Guhmension",
  ],
  "quest.475548E2E5895B46.title": "How do you get here?",
  "quest.475548E2E5895B46.quest_desc": [
    "This chapter comes after &dWelcome to the Guhmension!&r in &dThe Guhmension&r: grab a pickaxe and dig down.",
    "",
    "Under the pink wool lie layers of &dFelt Stone&r, &dSnugglestone&r and &dGuh Crystal Stone&r, with ores in every layer, caves with their own mood (and a happy little tune), sauce lakes, creatures and dozens of buildings. The &6Super Compass&r (tab &6Underground&r) shows the way to the buildings, and the cave minigames are under &6Minigames&r.",
    "",
    "You only find all this in new parts of the world. Nothing is locked: every quest ticks itself off as soon as you have done it, even if you did it before. The headings show what logically comes after what. Tick this off and get vadsing!",
  ],
  "quest.475548C06561D026.title": "Under the wool",
  "quest.475548C06561D026.quest_desc": [
    "Dig down through the pink wool. A little below the surface the wool stops and the &dFelt Stone&r begins: soft, quick to mine and the first layer of the Guhmension underground. Mine 16!",
  ],
  "quest.4755485207448E5F.title": "Felt in every shape",
  "quest.4755485207448E5F.quest_desc": [
    "Felt Stone is a lovely building block too: polished, as bricks, tiles or chiselled, with stairs, slabs and walls. Make them at the crafting table or the stonecutter. Start with Felt Stone Bricks.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488508CB5B71.title": "Snugglestone by the heap",
  "quest.4755488508CB5B71.quest_desc": [
    "Deeper down the stone gets harder: &dSnugglestone&r. It used to be expensive, now you simply mine it out of the ground. Under mountains it starts higher, under valleys and the sea lower.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BE98526A69.title": "Pink veins",
  "quest.475548BE98526A69.quest_desc": [
    "Pink veins of &dPink Plush Stone&r run through the Snugglestone, with little pockets of pink wool here and there and rose quartz drops on the walls.",
  ],
  "quest.475548744358EB41.title": "The deep layer",
  "quest.475548744358EB41.quest_desc": [
    "Deeper still, where the caves get gigantic: &dGuh Crystal Stone&r. Below it there is only the &5Plush Seam&r: you can't get through that, njeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548460D12F18C.title": "Guh Clay",
  "quest.475548460D12F18C.quest_desc": [
    "The Felt Stone and the Snugglestone hold big blobs of &dGuh Clay&r. Mine them normally and you get clay balls (for bricks). With Silk Touch you keep the block whole, and that bakes into pink terracotta. The Miner in Vads Mine Town sells it too.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E6FFA6D000.title": "Felt Gravel",
  "quest.475548E6FFA6D000.quest_desc": [
    "Along brooks and shores lies &dFelt Gravel&r: soft gravel made of little felt balls. It falls just like gravel.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483AC2433ECA.title": "Iron in the Felt Stone",
  "quest.4755483AC2433ECA.quest_desc": [
    "Every layer has its own ores: coal, copper, iron, gold, lapis, redstone, diamond and emerald, just like in the Overworld, but in Felt Stone, Snugglestone or Crystal Stone. Iron is most common around the border of Felt Stone and Snugglestone.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BBB33321A2.title": "Vads from the stone",
  "quest.475548BBB33321A2.quest_desc": [
    "Vads ore sits in the Snugglestone and the Crystal Stone, most of all deep down. Deeper is richer!",
  ],
  "quest.4755480C6A8F5ABA.title": "Cheese crumbs",
  "quest.4755480C6A8F5ABA.quest_desc": [
    "Around the sauce lakes there is cheese crumb ore. Mine it and you get cheese crumbs.",
  ],
  "quest.47554814C85ED327.title": "Pastel from the stone",
  "quest.47554814C85ED327.quest_desc": [
    "Pigment ore in the Snugglestone gives pastel dye, and the rarer colours sit deeper. Just right for pastel bricks and plaster! Start with pink.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B0FC9E29E4.title": "Diamond in the Crystal Stone",
  "quest.475548B0FC9E29E4.quest_desc": [
    "Diamond ore sits mostly deep in the Guh Crystal Stone. Bring a good pickaxe!",
  ],
  "quest.4755489643C5D067.title": "VAHOEGITE!",
  "quest.4755489643C5D067.quest_desc": [
    "The rarest ore: &5Vahoegite&r. Only in the Guh Crystal Stone, very deep, and in the plush heart geodes. You need it for the Glitter Altar, the Saddle Bag, super vahoege vads and the Miner Guh House.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DD3F28574D.title": "The Fluff Cave",
  "quest.475548DD3F28574D.quest_desc": [
    "A soft cave in the Felt Stone: fluff wool, fluff grass, fluff balls and fluff cushions you land on softly (with a little bounce).",
  ],
  "quest.47554840854191D9.title": "The Sleepy Cave",
  "quest.47554840854191D9.quest_desc": [
    "A cave full of fluff cushions and wool, with night lights. Wild guhs lie there sleeping: zzz... Pet one and it wakes up.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BA15916DE8.title": "The Plush Root Cave",
  "quest.475548BA15916DE8.quest_desc": [
    "Only under forests: hanging plush tree roots, moss and soft plush root soil.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BAFFF723D3.title": "The Glitter Cavern",
  "quest.475548BAFFF723D3.quest_desc": [
    "Pink glow moss, glitter vines with glitter berries, glitter toadstools and wild glowworms. It sparkles in every direction!",
  ],
  "quest.47554869EDD3B162.title": "The Little Bells Cave",
  "quest.47554869EDD3B162.quest_desc": [
    "Crystals that play a note when you step on them or tap them. Every spot has its own note: play a tune!",
  ],
  "quest.4755487F50CAC044.title": "The Crystal Icicle Cave",
  "quest.4755487F50CAC044.quest_desc": [
    "Pink guh crystal icicles on the ceiling and the floor, with drops of cheese sauce. Mind your head: a falling icicle hurts!",
  ],
  "quest.475548D099F17C9A.title": "Glitter berries",
  "quest.475548D099F17C9A.quest_desc": [
    "Pick a glitter berry from a glitter vine in the Glitter Cavern (right-click). Deliciously sparkly!",
  ],
  "quest.4755484F490023B0.title": "Ding dong guh",
  "quest.4755484F490023B0.quest_desc": [
    "Take a Bell Crystal home from the Little Bells Cave and build your own guh xylophone.",
  ],
  "quest.4755482971DBC4D2.title": "The Cave Guh",
  "quest.4755482971DBC4D2.quest_desc": [
    "The caves are mostly home to ordinary wild guhs, but very rarely you see a &dCave Guh&r: deep pink, with crystal speckles that glow softly in the dark. A little more often in the Glitter Cavern. Come close for your Guhdex.",
  ],
  "quest.4755486EE34554A2.title": "Peekaboo!",
  "quest.4755486EE34554A2.quest_desc": [
    "In the Felt Stone and Snugglestone caves a &dmole guh&r with little glasses sometimes pops its head out of the ground. Now and then it leaves something behind: guh clay, dye or (very rarely) Vahoegite. Come close for your Guhdex.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E834B2AC9A.title": "The Abandoned Guh Mine",
  "quest.475548E834B2AC9A.quest_desc": [
    "An old tunnel network of the miner guhs, just like a mineshaft: chest sleds, a canteen, a sled depot and a collapsed bit here and there. Look in the sleds! (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.47554884F7F36C5E.title": "Cave Paintings",
  "quest.47554884F7F36C5E.quest_desc": [
    "A tall hall with a big fresco all around: how everything turned pink, and the Plush Heart. Read the signs at every scene. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755487E4EFDA62A.title": "The Sauce Lake Fishing Hut",
  "quest.4755487E4EFDA62A.quest_desc": [
    "A hut on stilts by a warm cheese sauce lake. The fish don't bite, the cheese does. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548F8A6E01E87.title": "The Abandoned Sled Station",
  "quest.475548F8A6E01E87.quest_desc": [
    "Platforms, sleds and a ticket office, deep under the ground. Departure: never. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548A31EB03FE3.title": "The Golden Sauce Dairy",
  "quest.475548A31EB03FE3.quest_desc": [
    "Sauce pumps, cheese vats and giant cheese wheels by a warm sauce lake. Don't dive into the vat! (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548E43C921496.title": "The Sunken Guh House",
  "quest.475548E43C921496.quest_desc": [
    "House Fluff once sank through the wool. Crooked, mossy, and somebody still lives there. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548BEEA704CE6.title": "The Giant Guh Fossil",
  "quest.475548BEEA704CE6.quest_desc": [
    "The skeleton of a primeval guh, deep in the Crystal Stone. Yes, the ears really were that big. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755485D4FD81C35.title": "The Crystal Nursery",
  "quest.4755485D4FD81C35.quest_desc": [
    "Growing beds full of guh crystals in four stages. Don't touch, they're still growing! (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.47554814EE68D972.title": "The Lost Building Crew",
  "quest.47554814EE68D972.quest_desc": [
    "An abandoned building site: half a tunnel, a little crane and piles of building materials. Where did the builder guhs go? (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755487C3776AE7E.title": "The Cave Guh Burrows",
  "quest.4755487C3776AE7E.quest_desc": [
    "The cosy home of the Cave Guhs: sleeping nooks, a campfire and a nibble store. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755485369CA2E0B.title": "The Warm Nibble Bathhouse",
  "quest.4755485369CA2E0B.quest_desc": [
    "A Roman bathhouse under the wool: three bath halls, nibble baths and cheese shakes. No running, only vadsing! The chests sometimes hold a &dBathrobe&r and a &dTowel Turban&r. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.47554840B53ECE83.title": "The Cave Disco",
  "quest.47554840B53ECE83.quest_desc": [
    "A secret disco in a crystal geode. DJ Njeg spins, the guhs dance up chonk power together. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548A308D151F2.title": "The Old Wool Spinnery",
  "quest.475548A308D151F2.quest_desc": [
    "The Wool Club: guhs spin wool together around tea tables, and a water wheel gives chonk power. Break time is every five minutes. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548E9A8ECC5D4.title": "The Star Cave",
  "quest.475548E9A8ECC5D4.quest_desc": [
    "A quiet dome cave with a starry ceiling, a picnic and a star pond. Make a wish on a falling star (cheese nibbles, preferably). (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548BB2A548A7E.title": "The Cuddle Dormitory",
  "quest.475548BB2A548A7E.quest_desc": [
    "An underground dormitory full of four-poster beds and sleeping guhs. Shhh! The chests sometimes hold a &dNightcap&r. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755481A6712783B.title": "The Mushroom Village",
  "quest.4755481A6712783B.quest_desc": [
    "Giant mushrooms with a little house in the cap: go through the door in the stem and climb up. With lights on strings and a glittering brook. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548CC9AE67554.title": "The Plush Pit",
  "quest.475548CC9AE67554.quest_desc": [
    "A ball pit full of plush blocks. Six little guhs are playing hide-and-seek: find them all! Shoes off. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.47554879E81F60D6.title": "The Surprise Party",
  "quest.47554879E81F60D6.quest_desc": [
    "A hidden cave where guhs are getting a birthday party ready, with a giant cake. Shhh, don't tell! The chests sometimes hold a &dParty Hat&r and a &dBunting Scarf&r. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.47554816ECE7CB9E.title": "The Old Guh Temple",
  "quest.47554816ECE7CB9E.quest_desc": [
    "Very rare: the huge temple complex of the old guhs, half buried, with The Great Guh and the Golden Cheese Nibble. Watch out for the sweet little traps, and find the path of light to the secret room. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755487C966424D3.title": "The Old Bank Vault",
  "quest.4755487C966424D3.quest_desc": [
    "Very rare: the old vault of the Bank Guh. Somebody tried to break in. Somebody with a moustache... (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.47554807ED2DDCEC.title": "A super template",
  "quest.47554807ED2DDCEC.quest_desc": [
    "The chests of the Old Guh Temple and the Old Bank Vault sometimes hold a &5Super Vads Template&r. Take good care of it! You can copy it: 7 Vahoegite and a Guh Crystal Stone.",
  ],
  "quest.47554877F6655F21.title": "The Mine Entrance Hut",
  "quest.47554877F6655F21.quest_desc": [
    "Above the ground there is sometimes a hut with a &dCloud Lift&r: jump on it and you float down. Your mine starts here! (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548AC74050099.title": "Mijnguh Village",
  "quest.475548AC74050099.quest_desc": [
    "Under the ground lies the village of the &dMiner Guh&r (there is always one not too far from the middle of the world), around a warm sauce lake, with a cloud lift up. He has a little job for you: see &6Miner Guh's Helper&r at the cheese mine. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.47554836F9048A00.title": "A bag full of ground",
  "quest.47554836F9048A00.quest_desc": [
    "Make a &6Saddle Bag&r (a saddle, a chest, pink wool and a Vahoegite) and put it on your tamed guh. It walks along with you and picks up every plain ground block you mine: wool, the layer stones, dirt, sand... Its bag holds endlessly much. Take things out in its little screen, or send everything to your Bank Guh.",
  ],
  "quest.47554834F6C3EDE9.title": "Vads Mine Town",
  "quest.47554834F6C3EDE9.quest_desc": [
    "In a big cave hall lies a whole little town full of guh villagers, with a Guh Wheel power station on the square that gives the village chonk power. Four new professions live there: the Wizard Guh, the Vads Mechanic, the Miner and the Crystal Cutter. And the Iron Guhlem keeps watch, just like an iron golem. (Super Compass: Underground.)",
  ],
  "quest.47554808207E5C87.title": "Pick it up",
  "quest.47554808207E5C87.quest_desc": [
    "Sneak and click a villager with an empty hand (a guh villager or a normal one): you pick it up, with its name, profession and trades. Click a block to put it down again. Handy when moving house!",
  ],
  "quest.475548B819CCDAC3.title": "A new profession",
  "quest.475548B819CCDAC3.quest_desc": [
    "Make the workstation of one of the new professions: the Wizard Guh Book Stand, the Guh Wheel Workbench, the Ore Chest or the Crystal Grindstone. Put it near a villager without a job and it takes that profession. Start with the Vads Mechanic's Guh Wheel Workbench.",
  ],
  "quest.4755487C6CC95ACA.title": "The Glitter Altar",
  "quest.4755487C6CC95ACA.quest_desc": [
    "The guh enchanting altar: a book, two Vahoegite, a guh crystal and three Guh Crystal Stone. Just like an enchanting table it costs lapis and levels. You get the useful vanilla enchantments, and guh spells you can only get here: &dMika Whacker&r, &dFluff Fall&r, &dGlitter Sight&r, &dVads Diligence&r and &dBaking Vads&r. The Wizard Guh sells spell books with even more: &dPiggy Guh&r, &dGentle Pat&r and &dCheese Nibble Scent&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A12E2F162C.title": "Cuddle Bookshelves",
  "quest.475548A12E2F162C.quest_desc": [
    "The Glitter Altar gets stronger with &dCuddle Bookshelves&r around it (normal bookshelves don't count). You see hearts flying from the shelves to the altar. Make a few from guh blossom planks, pink wool and books.",
  ],
  "quest.47554851D66A5CDF.title": "The Vahoege Vadscracker",
  "quest.47554851D66A5CDF.quest_desc": [
    "Put a vahoege vads paxel, vahoege vads shears and a vahoege vads hoe together at the crafting table: pickaxe, axe, shovel, hoe and shears in one! Their enchantments come along. Right-click is smart: grass becomes farmland, logs get stripped, a sheep gets sheared. Sneak and right-click grass: a path.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484747A594CD.title": "The Vahoegite Ingot",
  "quest.4755484747A594CD.quest_desc": [
    "Four Vahoegite and four vahoege vads ingots make a &5Vahoegite Ingot&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548973E8AE280.title": "Super vahoege vads",
  "quest.475548973E8AE280.quest_desc": [
    "At the smithing table: the Super Vads Template, a piece of vahoege vads and a Vahoegite Ingot. That makes your vads things super, as strong as netherite. Start with a Super Vahoege Vads Pickaxe.",
  ],
  "quest.47554898D0F31280.title": "The Cloud Lift",
  "quest.47554898D0F31280.quest_desc": [
    "Put a Cloud Lift at the bottom of your mine and one above it on the surface. Jump on it and you float up to the next one; sneak and you go down.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A8239B7775.title": "The Fluff Ladder",
  "quest.475548A8239B7775.quest_desc": [
    "Put a Fluff Ladder against the wall at the edge of a hole: it unrolls down to the floor by itself.",
  ],
  "quest.475548FDFFFCF0C0.title": "A lamp for your guh",
  "quest.475548FDFFFCF0C0.quest_desc": [
    "A pink helmet with a little lamp (a lantern and pink wool). Put it on your guh: it gives light in the dark wherever it walks. A walking lamp!",
  ],
  "quest.475548130C0384F6.title": "A bigger terrarium",
  "quest.475548130C0384F6.quest_desc": [
    "Terrariums can be as big as you like now: everything joined together by Terrarium Glass and Terrarium Floor is one living space, with little tunnels too and in any shape. Make Terrarium Floor from Terrarium Glass, sand and stripped oak.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BE092F7DCE.title": "The Flower Valley",
  "quest.475548BE092F7DCE.quest_desc": [
    "A small, rare valley full of flowers in every guh colour, with bees, butterflies and fluff in the air.",
  ],
  "quest.4755486F44BFD227.title": "From spring to spring",
  "quest.4755486F44BFD227.quest_desc": [
    "The Guhmension has brooks now: they wind from one little spring to the next, with pink sparkles above the water and glitter reed along the banks. Take a Little Spring home for your own pond.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F97C102D7B.title": "A pink beach",
  "quest.475548F97C102D7B.quest_desc": [
    "Next to the normal beaches there are pink beaches now, with little shells. Scoop up some pink sand.",
  ],
  "quest.475548419B888EB9.title": "Heart lakes",
  "quest.475548419B888EB9.quest_desc": [
    "You only see it from above: some little lakes are shaped like a heart, with a rim of flowers. Pick a Heart Lily Pad.",
  ],
  "quest.47554832468B854A.title": "Treasure Dig",
  "quest.47554832468B854A.quest_desc": [
    "Above the ground stands a hut with a Cloud Lift down. In the cave below, &6Captain Shovelsnout&r waits with &6Sniffy&r (Super Compass: Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.475548728B5CFC06.title": "Cold, warm, HOT!",
  "quest.475548728B5CFC06.quest_desc": [
    "Dig up treasures with the soft shovel. Sniffy squeaks cold, warm or HOT and jumps when you're nearly there. A golden cheese is a bonus, a squeaky cheese costs time. You earn &6treasure coins&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548FF86794E52.title": "Ahoy, little pirate!",
  "quest.475548FF86794E52.quest_desc": [
    "Buy the Pirate Hat and the Eye Patch from Captain Shovelsnout, for treasure coins.",
  ],
  "quest.475548250C3E6B6B.title": "Glowworm Catching",
  "quest.475548250C3E6B6B.quest_desc": [
    "Under a hut with a Cloud Lift lies a dark hall full of glowworms. That's where &6Miss Glimmy&r lives (Super Compass: Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.47554881F9BCE516.title": "Catch them with your net",
  "quest.47554881F9BCE516.quest_desc": [
    "Catch as many glowworms as you can. The jar on your back starts to glow and the hall gets lighter and lighter. A golden glowworm counts extra! You earn &6glimmer coins&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A437653A6F.title": "A glowworm yourself",
  "quest.475548A437653A6F.quest_desc": [
    "Buy the Glowworm Feelers and the Butterfly Net from Miss Glimmy, for glimmer coins.",
  ],
  "quest.47554832CEE0E7B8.title": "The Little Lights Puzzle",
  "quest.47554832CEE0E7B8.quest_desc": [
    "Under a hut with a Cloud Lift lies a cave with a big grid of toadstool lamps. &6Master Blinky&r explains it (Super Compass: Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.4755481F558E3C0F.title": "All lights on!",
  "quest.4755481F558E3C0F.quest_desc": [
    "A lamp flips, together with its four neighbours. Get them all on before the time runs out. A new puzzle every game! You earn &6lamp coins&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A59772AB66.title": "A glowing hat",
  "quest.475548A59772AB66.quest_desc": [
    "Buy the Glowing Toadstool Hat from Master Blinky, for lamp coins.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D1185FF884.title": "The Switch Cave",
  "quest.475548D1185FF884.quest_desc": [
    "Under a hut with a Cloud Lift lies a cave full of mine tracks. &6Conducteur Piepwiel&r is looking for a switch keeper (Super Compass: Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.4755487F34EB4DEE.title": "Switch them!",
  "quest.4755487F34EB4DEE.quest_desc": [
    "Stand on the balcony and set the switches with the levers, so every ore cart rolls into the bin of its own colour. Lose three carts and the shift is over. You earn &6ore tickets&r.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489ADDC2EC9F.title": "On time, on track",
  "quest.4755489ADDC2EC9F.quest_desc": [
    "Bring in 25 carts correctly in one shift.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B5198CD2CE.title": "Head switch keeper",
  "quest.475548B5198CD2CE.quest_desc": [
    "Bring in 40 carts correctly on the hard network.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E53122893B.title": "Conductor!",
  "quest.475548E53122893B.quest_desc": [
    "Buy the Conductor's Cap from Conducteur Piepwiel, for ore tickets.",
  ],
  "quest.475548AD62B7D655.title": "The Bowling Cave",
  "quest.475548AD62B7D655.quest_desc": [
    "Under a hut with a big pin on its roof lies a bowling alley in the cave. &6De Guhde&r lends you a wool ball (Super Compass: Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.475548DD1B815C39.title": "Ten frames",
  "quest.475548DD1B815C39.quest_desc": [
    "Play a whole game: look where the ball should go, hold right-click for power and let go. Stand a little to the side for some hook. You earn &6pin buttons&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E32E032C41.title": "STRIKE!",
  "quest.475548E32E032C41.quest_desc": [
    "Knock over all ten plush guh pins at once. Squeak squeak squeak!",
  ],
  "quest.475548882DF00EC3.title": "One hundred and fifty",
  "quest.475548882DF00EC3.quest_desc": [
    "Bowl 150 points or more in one game.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F75AE7E0B9.title": "The perfect game",
  "quest.475548F75AE7E0B9.quest_desc": [
    "300 points: twelve strikes in a row. The Guhde abides.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CF4C312BA9.title": "Bowling champion",
  "quest.475548CF4C312BA9.quest_desc": [
    "Buy the Bowling Shirt and the Bowling Sweatband from De Guhde, for pin buttons.",
  ],
}
